
  db_audit_gm -- api node (one of the customer's applications)

  Endpoints:      /srv/api/api.yaml        which hostname serves which endpoint
                  /srv/api/routes/<name>.py  the contract (read-only)
                  /srv/api/db/<name>.py      its database side: queries, transactions,
                                             session settings
  Request log:    /var/log/api/api.log
  Served on:      http://<hostname>:8000/
  Apply changes:  sudo gm-reload-api        check db/, then restart the server
  Check:          sudo gm-validate          public validator

  DO NOT TAMPER with SSH, sudo, the gm-* wrappers, the validator or gm_api.

